{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","title":"Trauma and the Lowering of Danger Detection Standards","description":"Bagaimana trauma masa lalu mempengaruhi kemampuan seseorang mendeteksi perilaku toxic.","tags":["psychology","trauma","npd"],"custom":{"description":"Bagaimana trauma masa lalu mempengaruhi kemampuan seseorang mendeteksi perilaku toxic."},"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"8a0003a45774e69e9e3c8635fb6a4034","updated":1782198659113,"created":1782198659113,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","id":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","id":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.trauma","alias":"trauma","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.trauma"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","id":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.npd","alias":"npd","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.npd"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","id":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":11,"offset":1294},"end":{"line":21,"column":57,"offset":1340},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","id":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":101,"offset":1384},"end":{"line":18,"column":147,"offset":1430},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","id":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":3,"offset":1982},"end":{"line":29,"column":49,"offset":2028},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard"}],"anchors":{"trauma-and-the-lowering-of-danger-detection-standards":{"type":"header","text":"Trauma and the Lowering of Danger Detection Standards","value":"trauma-and-the-lowering-of-danger-detection-standards","line":15,"column":0,"depth":1},"the-bitter-taste-analogy":{"type":"header","text":"The \"Bitter Taste\" Analogy","value":"the-bitter-taste-analogy","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"impact-on-relationship-patterns":{"type":"header","text":"Impact on Relationship Patterns","value":"impact-on-relationship-patterns","line":22,"column":0,"depth":2},"breaking-the-cycle":{"type":"header","text":"Breaking the Cycle","value":"breaking-the-cycle","line":28,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"trauma-and-the-lowering-of-danger-detection-standards\">Trauma and the Lowering of Danger Detection Standards<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#trauma-and-the-lowering-of-danger-detection-standards\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"trauma-and-the-lowering-of-danger-detection-standards-1\">Trauma and the Lowering of Danger Detection Standards<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#trauma-and-the-lowering-of-danger-detection-standards-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"the-bitter-taste-analogy\">The \"Bitter Taste\" Analogy<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-bitter-taste-analogy\"></a></h2>\n<p>Seseorang yang tumbuh dalam trauma kronik atau lingkungan yang tidak sehat seringkali memiliki standar \"baik\" yang sangat rendah.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Analogi</strong>: Orang yang terbiasa makan pahit akan menganggap satu butir gula sebagai makanan terenak.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"impact-on-relationship-patterns\">Impact on Relationship Patterns<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#impact-on-relationship-patterns\"></a></h2>\n<p>Hal ini menjelaskan mengapa korban NPD sering terjebak dalam pola relasi yang sama:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Low Baseline</strong>: Karena terbiasa dengan pengabaian atau kekerasan, sedikit perhatian terasa seperti cinta yang luar biasa.</li>\n<li><strong>Love Bombing Effectiveness</strong>: Teknik <em>love bombing</em> menjadi sangat efektif karena \"tangki afeksi\" korban dalam keadaan kosong.</li>\n<li><strong>Rescue Mission</strong>: Korban sering bertahan karena percaya bahwa mereka bisa menjadi \"misi penyelamatan\" bagi pelaku, mengabaikan realita bahwa perubahan hanya terjadi jika pelaku itu sendiri yang menginginkannya.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"breaking-the-cycle\">Breaking the Cycle<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#breaking-the-cycle\"></a></h2>\n<p>Memutus rantai trauma membutuhkan pembangunan ulang standar:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Standar Cinta</strong>: Membedakan antara perhatian manipulatif dan kasih sayang yang sehat.</li>\n<li><strong>Standar Boundary</strong>: Belajar berkata tidak tanpa rasa bersalah.</li>\n<li><strong>Standar Realita</strong>: Melihat perilaku pelaku apa adanya, bukan berdasarkan potensi atau \"sisi baik\" yang sesekali muncul.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check\">Boundary vs Reality Check</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">trauma (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">npd (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem\">NPD as a Social Ecosystem Disruptor</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn 